msgid ""
"Tick this on a sale tax that is not VAT - a packaging deposit (SGR), an eco fee, a WEEE contribution. In a retail warehouse the shelf price is split into cost, markup (378) and the VAT that becomes exigible on sale (4428); a charge collected on behalf of somebody else is none of those, so it is kept out of the split and out of the value carried on 371.\n"
"Tick it on every variant of the charge a fiscal position can map to, the VAT included one included."
